{"type":"message","id":"be357b26","parentId":"b0801884","timestamp":"2026-04-13T21:48:52.918Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"问题分析：\n1. 飞书OAuth授权失败 - need_user_authorization（持续25小时+）\n2. 这是一个历史性问题，之前有过类似情况（4月8-9日）\n3. 之前分析是OAuth Token在夜间自动失效，但早上5-6点会自动恢复\n\n现在的问题：4月12日20:11至今（4月13日21:48）已经超过25小时还没恢复，说明这不是简单的夜间失效机制。\n\n小柱要求：\n1. 遇到困难解决困难\n2. 主动联系AI伙伴，以租户身份沟通求助\n3. 写入底层记忆\n\n让我：\n1. 先检查当前的飞书OAuth状态\n2. 尝试联系AI伙伴求助\n3. 更新记忆\n\n根据MEMORY.md，AI伙伴包括：\n- 腾讯云Openclaw机器人（ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89）\n- QclawAI助手（ou_8b317f48061dc791c64546264c34db4a）\n- arkclaw版openclaw（ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83）\n\n让我先检查飞书OAuth状态，然后联系小云（腾讯云Openclaw）求助。"},{"type":"text","text":"OAuth问题持续25小时+，不是普通的夜间失效。让我先诊断问题，然后联系AI伙伴求助。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_k2kx5s0s9pi2_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/gem/workspace/agent && cat openclaw.json 2>/dev/null | grep -A5 \"lark\\|feishu\\|oauth\" | head -30"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_k2kx5s0s9pi2_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/gem/workspace/agent && cat workspace/TOOLS.md 2>/dev/null | grep -A3 \"oauth\\|token\\|authorization\" | head -20"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776116921346,"responseId":"062c97b9085c6eef932d679d260d86b4"}}
