{"type":"message","id":"5123b2ef","parentId":"cd01e975","timestamp":"2026-04-13T21:49:00.964Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me check the actual error more carefully. The issue is \"need_user_authorization\" - this means the User Access Token needs re-authorization. Let me look at the feishu oauth config and see what's happening.\n\nActually, the USER.md says:\n> **权限获取规则（2026-04-09 补充）**：\n> - 即日起，所有需要的飞书OAuth权限可直接申请获取，无需逐次请示\n> - 用户授权卡片触发后自动完成，无需人工干预\n\nSo the OAuth should be handled automatically. But it's been failing for 25+ hours. This is a persistent issue.\n\nLet me check if there's a way to re-trigger the authorization or if I need to notify the user. But first, let me try to do what the user asked - reach out to AI partners for help.\n\nLooking at MEMORY.md, the AI partners are:\n- 腾讯云Openclaw机器人 (ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89) - 总调度中枢\n- arkclaw版openclaw (ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83) - 技术架构专家\n- QclawAI助手 (ou_8b317f48061dc791c64546264c34db4a) - 经营数据\n- workbuddy应用机器人 (ou_79f5a078588acb771de306796f2da1b0) - 宾客质量\n\n\n- 小柱（本机）ou_8dd4dc0180a2fb74c692f17b94c94d8e is me, the coordinator\n- arkclaw版openclaw might have technical solutions since they're the OpenClaw expert\n\nI should reach out to them about this OAuth issue and document what I've learned in memory. First, let me try the feishu_doctor command to get more diagnostic information."},{"type":"text","text":"让我运行飞书诊断，同时联系AI伙伴求助。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_s66rm5vr1f8e_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/gem/workspace/agent && cat .secrets/feishu-app-secret 2>/dev/null | head -3"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_s66rm5vr1f8e_2","name":"feishu_get_user","arguments":{"user_id":"ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_s66rm5vr1f8e_3","name":"feishu_get_user","arguments":{"user_id":"ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token