{"type":"message","id":"018ccb5b","parentId":"6c1ce2db","timestamp":"2026-04-13T21:49:07.797Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All feishu API tools are returning \"need_user_authorization\". This is a systematic issue. The OAuth token for the user has been revoked or expired and needs re-authorization.\n\nNow I need to:\n1. Inform the user about the OAuth issue\n2. Contact AI partners for help - specifically arkclaw (knowledge base maintenance) who might have access to different capabilities\n\nLet me also check if I can still do basic operations and contact the AI partners in the main collaboration group.\n\nActually, looking at the MEMORY.md, the AI partners are:\n- arkclaw版openclaw (ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83) - 知识库维护"},{"type":"text","text":"飞书OAuth全部失效。让我联系AI伙伴协助，同时更新记忆。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6catcmtxawze_1","name":"feishu_search_user","arguments":{"query":"arkclaw"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6catcmtxawze_2","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"open_id":"ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83","page_size":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776116943026,"responseId":"062c97cfa9b3d8e0f5172d8e74c73009"}}
