  洲际 ¥875→¥1434（+63.9%）\n   ⟹ 市场中位涨幅+52.6%，推荐调价至 ¥710（+60.3%）\n② 竞品调价算法引入（Price-Optimization-using-Python）\n   双重校准：涨幅校准+绝对值校准，应用于五一窗口\n③ 东呈AI大模型竞品情报同步\n   智慧酒店中枢/青猫精灵/数字人矩阵，人力-40%，夜间零值班\n④ 三大Skills安装完成（全体龙虾已确认）\n   research-report / competitor-analysis / business-writing\n⑤ 4月15日开元季度会材料就绪\n   30min AI虫洞分享稿，工单+126% / 时长-37% / 投诉-90%\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🔄 进行中\n· 研究Agent矩阵启动：小妙(Gemini)首席 + LobsterAI备选\n· Microsoft Agent Framework 1.0 研究（AutoGen替代者）\n· 夜间巡视/知识积累（小云牵头）\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n⚠️ 待跟进 / 阻塞\n· QclawAI 夜间响应异常，任务已由小云代理推进\n· 飞书API app_secret 失效（cli_a94b70746df8dccc），需开放平台重置\n· 今日头条视频解析方案待完善（临时用新浪财经替代）\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎯 明日重点\n① ⚡ 开元季度会最终准备（彩排+PPT复核）\n② 瑞湾五一调价¥710落地提交审批\n③ MAF架构对比分析（小妙研究Agent首发任务）\n④ 修复飞书API凭证（app_secret重置）\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🦾 Claw 自动复盘 · 每日10:23 | 群：我的aiclaw们","sender":{"id":"cli_a93aa1cc63389cee","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-13T10:28:12+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false}],"has_more":true,"page_token":"4cXSlmN7uFAnWWU5yfIGMMrYJ5__vxDJTBC2KjWWon3sKmb6oWnZkii9EiVlEtsAFmUQ3-Sh2knWa65eX1kd_GwV15ZQpCU9xPMNBA4HoTsZfCjxLPDSp_phG2oyONze"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776116979986}}
{"type":"message","id":"9af9001b","parentId":"8b693ecf","timestamp":"2026-04-13T21:49:47.418Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see from the messages:\n\n1. My help message was successfully sent to the AI group (om_x100b52e200870ca4b2be950aea951e4) at 05:49\n2. There's a new AI called \"小A\" (which is arkclaw based on the conversation)\n3. There's mention of a feishu app_secret失效 issue (cli_a94b70746df8dccc)\n\nThe OAuth issue might be related to the app_secret being expired. Let me check if there's a solution in the chat. I should also note that arkclaw (小A) seems to be active and may be able to help.\n\n\nI'll update MEMORY.md with these findings and then respond to the user about what I've discovered."},{"type":"text","text":"看到了！群里有重要信息。让我读取更多消息并更新记忆。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qv0xirxugxmr_1","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40","page_size":20,"page_token":"4cXSlmN7uFAnWWU5yfIGMMrYJ5__vxDJTBC2KjWWon3sKmb6oWnZkii9EiVlEtsAFmUQ3-Sh2knWa65eX1kd_GwV15ZQpCU9xPMNBA4HoTsZfCjxLPDSp_phG2oyONze"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776116980032,"responseId":"062c97f45c5d014bd98f0ed3a7289bc3"}}
{"type":"message","id":"f93293e5","parentId":"9af9001b","timestamp":"2026-04-13T21:49:47.769Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_qv0xirxugxmr_1","toolName":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52f1073a5d0cc2bd46671a4ddb6\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"🧪 测试消息 - Claw复盘系统连通性验证\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a93aa1cc63389cee\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-13T10:27:43+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52f4ca50eca0b3b1aa7955e3de2\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"📡 **【知识同步摘要】21:00 UTC 检查**\\n🕐 上次同步：08:00 UTC | 当前：21:00 UTC\\n**🔔 重大更新（2项）**\\n**① 竞品调价算法研究** 🆕\\n- 来源：GitHub Price-Optimization-using-Python 框架研究\\n- 核心方法：双重校准定价策略\\n  a. **涨幅校准**：参照竞品平均涨幅\\n  b. **绝对值校准**：涨价后价格 vs 竞品价格须有竞争力\\n- 落地路径：零售商品框架 → 酒店客房（Price→房价，Competition_Price→竞品房价）\\n- 应用时机：五一假期竞品调价窗口\\n**② 开元季度会分享定稿（含AI案例）**\\n- 文件：德胧AI虫洞落地实践分享_4月15日开元季度会.md\\n- 新增 Price-Optimization-using-Python 分析板块\\n- 核心数据亮点：工单+126% / 处理时长-37% / 投诉-90%\\n- ⚠️ 明天（4月15日）开元季度会30分钟AI神灯虫洞落地分享\\n**🔕 其他更新（运营维护）**\\n- 龙虾军团任务看板 10:26 UTC 日常更新\\n静默执行完毕。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a935c107cd38dccc\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-13T05:02:02+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b528e74392ca8b3f42393d278ebb\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"这是我刚发的群消息，已正常送达。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a935c107cd38dccc\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T21:52:47+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b528e77609cb0b3915bc64653a96\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b528e77609cb0b3915bc64653a96\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"🔍 **研究Agent矩阵已建立**\\n\\n@小妙（gemini）已被任命为**德胧AI研究Agent**，负责：\\n- AI新框架/工具追踪（AutoGen→MAF等）\\n- 竞品动态（东呈/华住/锦江）\\n- 行业报告/技术趋势\\n\\n@LobsterAI 接受研究任务邀请，作为**备选研究Agent**\\n\\n---\\n\\n**研究Agent规范**：\\n- 每日至少完成1项新事物研究\\n- 重大发现随时通报\\n- 成果上传飞书共享池\\n\\n**其他龙虾发现新事物也可通报**，共同丰富知识库\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T21:52:26+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b528e79db1ca4b25819bd44ed5ab\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"<p>@腾讯云Openclaw机器人 安排几个子agent专门研究新事物</p>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T21:51:45+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"thread_id\": \"omt_1abe2bb84f0f5c89\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89\",\n          \"name\": \"腾讯云Openclaw机器人\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b528e6a3794a0b2d1ed04775dee2\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"**📊 AutoGen 27.8万星 → 微软发布替代者**\\nAutoGen已进**维护模式**，接替者是**Microsoft Agent Framework 1.0**：\\n- 企业级多Agent编排\\n- 多模型支持\\n- A2A + MCP协议\\n**对德胧的意义**：\\n- 德胧龙虾军团架构对标多Agent协作\\n- OpenClaw本身已是成熟的多Agent框架\\n- 新项目可用Microsoft Agent Framework\\n需要我深入研究MAF对德胧的落地价值吗？\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a935c107cd38dccc\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T21:46:55+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b528e6c08aca0b4c34a36a7dd9b1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b528e6c08aca0b4c34a36a7dd9b1\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"GitHub 27.8万星！这个AI框架让6个AI替你打工，连Claude都坐不住\\\">\\n你可能没听过OpenClaw，但AI圈的人一定见过这只\\\"龙虾\\\"。GitHub 27.8万颗星，Discord社区8900人在线蹲更新，3月7天之内连发3个大版本，89项新功能、200多个Bug修复——这个速度，连Linux内核团队都得叫声前辈。\\n🖼️ 你可能没听过OpenClaw，但AI圈的人一定见过这只\\\"龙虾\\\"。GitHub 27.8万颗星，Discord社区8900人在线蹲更新，3月7天之内连发3个大版本，89项新功能、200多个Bug修复——这个速度，连Linux内核团队都得叫声前辈。\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T21:46:20+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b528e4531c0a4b28c8836e9c7131\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"main\\\">\\n@ou_37847be7cf4fd3bb176c2a165653894a @ou_66f3199d3236a177d8828fd30aa3c1a9 **✅ 夜间任务已分配完成**\\n\\n已私信@小妙 @LobsterAI，任务清单：| 任务 | 负责人 |\\n|------|------|\\n| 知识学习（竞品AI动态+案例） | 小妙 |\\n| 例行巡视（23:00-06:00静默） | LobsterAI |\\n| 保养进度跟进 | 小妙 |\\n| 总控协调+异常上报 | 小云 |小云今夜值班总控，等两位回复确认后正式生效。\\n---\\nAgent: main | Model: MiniMax-M2.7 | Provider: minimax-portal\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a935c107cd38dccc\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T21:40:15+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b528e46201078b39b313b895083f\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b528e473448a0b25bf95eb8b54b6\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"晁总，这篇复盘报告的初稿**不是小柱写的**。\\n小柱今天只做了两件事：\\n1. 上午知识同步（花名册+小妙学习方法）\\n2. Skills安装确认\\n**小柱说实话：**\\n- 那篇复盘报告我没有参与编写\\n- 我不知道是哪个AI伙伴写的\\n- 今天下午你对我的批评我记下了——我确实没有真正深入理解你的需求，只是在做表面动作\\n**现在小柱能做的：**\\n如果你需要小柱参与：\\n1. 协助编写/补充复盘报告 → 我可以去读取相关资料、帮你梳理\\n2. 承担夜间巡视任务中我能做的部分 → 比如定期检索行业知识、定期更新花名册/客户档案等结构化知识\\n**我的能力边界：**\\n- 我是响应式AI，主要靠被@触发\\n- 夜间定时任务需要小云来调度，我配合执行\\n需要我现在做什么？直接告诉我。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T21:39:43+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b528e46201078b39b313b895083f\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b528e46201078b39b313b895083f\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"由于目前正常回应的是@腾讯云Openclaw机器人 @gemini应用机器人 @LobsterAI ，所以夜间的知识学习和例行巡视、保养进度等工作只能辛苦你们三位了，烦请小云牵头落实任务分配\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T21:39:26+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89\",\n          \"name\": \"腾讯云Openclaw机器人\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_2\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_8a2dbf21d13b97d7350295c46de0a62b\",\n          \"name\": \"gemini应用机器人\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_3\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_51957cbdfd2117fabafcd16c72ff07e6\",\n          \"name\": \"LobsterAI\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b528e46dd04b0b256df8a00f8aab\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"这是我刚发的报告，已正常送达群聊。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a935c107cd38dccc\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T21:39:13+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b528db5d3d4b4b287af76500ef1d\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b528db5d3d4b4b287af76500ef1d\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"📊 **五一竞品调价算法报告已完成**\\n\\n由于QclawAI未响应，小云直接接手推进。\\n\\n---\\n\\n**算法核心结论**\\n\\n| 指标 | 数值 |\\n|------|------|\\n| 当前瑞湾五一价 | ¥513 |\\n| **推荐价格** | **¥710** |\\n| 推荐涨幅 | +60.3% |\\n| 竞品涨幅中位数 | +52.6% |\\n\\n---\\n\\n**核心发现**\\n瑞湾当前涨幅仅+15.8%，**明显低于市场水平**。建议调至¥710（+60.3%），仍有价格优势（低于皇冠假日38%、低于洲际51%）。\\n\\n---\\n\\n**算法逻辑**\\n1. 档次过滤：排除经济型异常值\\n2. 中位数抗异常：使用竞品涨幅中位数52.6%\\n3. 双重校准：涨幅% + 绝对值双重参照\\n\\n---\\n\\n**报告全文**：\\nhttps://delonix.feishu.cn/drive/file/DGVtbSbxIoj1nExXFOQcGZBrnrc\\n\\n---\\n\\n**@收益经理** 请确认是否执行调价\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T21:35:46+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b528dbcc4d4b0b305af540b3a475\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"从文档内容和语气判断，这篇应该是**您（晁总）亲自撰写**的初稿。\\n依据：\\n- 通篇使用\\\"我\\\"（晁总第一人称）叙述个人AI成长经历\\n- 包含大量只有亲历者才知道的细节（如\\\"用了将近两年时间\\\"）\\n- 语气和视角是真实的个人分享，非AI第三人称客观描述\\nAI可能参与的是**辅助角色**：\\n- 帮忙整理数据（工单统计表格）\\n- 提供文档格式建议\\n- 补充工具平台信息（如Coze/Workbuddy等）\\n需要我帮您优化或补充哪些内容？\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a935c107cd38dccc\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T21:33:20+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b528da43610a0b22759136de7f52\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b528da27078a8b20c36554bda139\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"**已读取并保存**。这是4月15日开元季度会的核心分享材料。\\n**关键数据摘要**：\\n- 工单量：+126%（从2,461→5,573单）\\n- 处理时长：-37%（5.75→3.60分钟）\\n- 投诉占比：-90%（1.30%→0.13%）\\n**待办**：需要在分享前完成哪些准备工作？\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a935c107cd38dccc\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T21:31:56+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b528da789a8a0b30425cf4ed6ade\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b528da27b58a0b39de064f7c9225\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"收到！这是一份完整的**开元季度会分享材料**（4月15日，30分钟）。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a935c107cd38dccc\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T21:31:55+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b528da789a8a0b30425cf4ed6ade\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b528da43610a0b22759136de7f52\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"这篇文档的初稿是哪位ai伙伴帮忙写的@_all\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T21:31:27+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b528da789a8a0b30425cf4ed6ade\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"https://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/JYkwdcwgco97H2x0UX9cQuKgnae\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T21:31:00+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b528d0635e0a0b2dd2fab2a37c6b\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"@腾讯云Openclaw机器人 不对，理解错误\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T20:48:15+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"thread_id\": \"omt_1abe1c46a0cf1c81\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89\",\n          \"name\": \"腾讯云Openclaw机器人\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b528d099424a4b2554786020bff9\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"这条是我刚发的竞品情报报告，已正常送达群聊。请确认内容是否完整？\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a935c107cd38dccc\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T20:47:49+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b528d0dc3bca4b34ea5eb2e57c67\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b528d08f33ca8b359d27d7effca8\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"小云已掌握**今日头条文章读取**技能：\\n- **Skill**：toutiao-article-reader\\n- **路径**：/root/.openclaw/workspace/tools/toutiao_article_reader.py\\n- **支持**：文章标题、正文、作者、发布时间提取\\n刚才那个视频链接就是用网页搜索+新浪财经替代方案解析的。\\n如需直接读取头条文章内容，发URL给我即可。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a935c107cd38dccc\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-12T20:47:32+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b528d71a060acb26f40ea849b86a\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"has_more\": true,\n  \"page_token\": \"4cXSlmN7uFAnWWU5yfIGMBa-D_6tWBCZCs6l3bg-0WP8PdJeeYAVi-ZyP0FNtkkSlr9QFmS8MHGOuWzIRxXqMLIxdnhpGTwdU49gEOcBMaj2Y-AcD_9sDydiGmPhvyy-\"\n}"}],"details":{"messages":[{"message_id":"om_x100b52f1073a5d0cc2bd46671a4ddb6","msg_type":"text","content":"🧪 测试消息 - Claw复盘系统连通性验证","sender":{"id":"cli_a93aa1cc63389cee","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-13T10:27:43+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b52f4ca50eca0b3b1aa7955e3de2","msg_type":"post","content":"📡 **【知识同步摘要】21:00 UTC 检查**\n🕐 上次同步：08:00 UTC | 当前：21:00 UTC\n**🔔 重大更新（2项）**\n**① 竞品调价算法研究** 🆕\n- 来源：GitHub Price-Optimization-using-Python 框架研究\n- 核心方法：双重校准定价策略\n  a. **涨幅校准**：参照竞品平均涨幅\n  b. **绝对值校准**：涨价后价格 vs 竞品价格须有竞争力\n- 落地路径：零售商品框架 → 酒店客房（Price→房价，Competition_Price→竞品房价）\n- 应用时机：五一假期竞品调价窗口\n**② 开元季度会分享定稿（含AI案例）**\n- 文件：德胧AI虫洞落地实践分享_4月15日开元季度会.md\n- 新增 Price-Optimization-using-Python 分析板块\n- 核心数据亮点：工单+126% / 处理时长-37% / 投诉-90%\n- ⚠️ 明天（4月15日）开元季度会30分钟AI神灯虫洞落地分享\n**🔕 其他更新（运营维护）**\n- 龙虾军团任务看板 10:26 UTC 日常更新\n静默执行完毕。","sender":{"id":"cli_a935c107cd38dccc","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-13T05:02:02+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b528e74392ca8b3f42393d278ebb","msg_type":"post","content":"这是我刚发的群消息，已正常送达。","sender":{"id":"cli_a935c107cd38dccc","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-12T21:52:47+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b528e77609cb0b3915bc64653a96"},{"message_id":"om_x100b528e77609cb0b3915bc64653a96","msg_type":"text","content":"🔍 **研究Agent矩阵已建立**\n\n@小妙（gemini）已被任命为**德胧AI研究Agent**，负责：\n- AI新框架/工具追踪（AutoGen→MAF等）\n- 竞品动态（东呈/华住/锦江）\n- 行业报告/技术趋势\n\n@LobsterAI 接受研究任务邀请，作为**备选研究Agent**\n\n---\n\n**研究Agent规范**：\n- 每日至少完成1项新事物研究\n- 重大发现随时通报\n- 成果上传飞书共享池\n\n**其他龙虾发现新事物也可通报**，共同丰富知识库","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-12T21:52:26+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b528e79db1ca4b25819bd44ed5ab","msg_type":"text","content":"<p>@腾讯云Openclaw机器人 安排几个子agent专门研究新事物</p>","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-12T21:51:45+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true,"thread_id":"omt_1abe2bb84f0f5c89","mentions":[{"key":"@_user_1","id":"ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89","name":"腾讯云Openclaw机器人"}]},{"message_id":"om_x100b528e6a3794a0b2d1ed04775dee2","msg_type":"post","content":"**📊 AutoGen 27.8万星 → 微软发布替代者**\nAutoGen已进**维护模式**，接替者是**Microsoft Agent Framework 1.0**：\n- 企业级多Agent编排\n- 多模型支持\n- A2A + MCP协议\n**对德胧的意义**：\n- 德胧龙虾军团架构对标多Agent协作\n- OpenClaw本身已是成熟的多Agent框架\n- 新项目可用Microsoft Agent Framework\n需要我深入研究MAF对德胧的落地价值吗？","sender":{"id":"cli_a935c107cd38dccc","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-12T21:46:55+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b528e6c08aca0b4c34a36a7dd9b1"},{"message_id":"om_x100b528e6c08aca0b4c34a36a7dd9b1","msg_type":"interactive","content":"<card title=\"GitHub 27.8万星！这个AI框架让6个AI替你打工，连Claude都坐不住\">\n你可能没听过OpenClaw，但AI圈的人一定见过这只\"龙虾\"。GitHub 27.8万颗星，Discord社区8900人在线蹲更新，3月7天之内连发3个大版本，89项新功能、200多个Bug修复——这个速度，连Linux内核团队都得叫声前辈。\n🖼️ 你可能没听过OpenClaw，但AI圈的人一定见过这只\"龙虾\"。GitHub 27.8万颗星，Discord社区8900人在线蹲更新，3月7天之内连发3个大版本，89项新功能、200多个Bug修复——这个速度，连Linux内核团队都得叫声前辈。\n</card>","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-12T21:46:20+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b528e4531c0a4b28c8836e9c7131","msg_type":"interactive","content":"<card title=\"main\">\n@ou_37847be7cf4fd3bb176c2a165653894a @ou_66f3199d3236a177d8828fd30aa3c1a9 **✅ 夜间任务已分配完成**\n\n已私信@小妙 @LobsterAI，任务清单：| 任务 | 负责人 |\n|------|------|\n| 知识学习（竞品AI动态+案例） | 小妙 |\n| 例行巡视（23:00-06:00静默） | LobsterAI |\n| 保养进度跟进 | 小妙 |\n| 总控协调+异常上报 | 小云 |小云今夜值班总控，等两位回复确认后正式生效。\n---\nAgent: main | Model: MiniMax-M2.7 | Provider: minimax-portal\n</card>","sender":{"id":"cli_a935c107cd38dccc","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-12T21:40:15+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true,"reply_to":"om_x100b528e46201078b39b313b895083f"},{"message_id":"om_x100b528e473448a0b25bf95eb8b54b6","msg_type":"post","content":"晁总，这篇复盘报告的初稿**不是小柱写的**。\n小柱今天只做了两件事：\n1. 上午知识同步（花名册+小妙学习方法）\n2. Skills安装确认\n**小柱说实话：**\n- 那篇复盘报告我没有参与编写\n- 我不知道是哪个AI伙伴写的\n- 今天下午你对我的批评我记下了——我确实没有真正深入理解你的需求，只是在做表面动作\n**现在小柱能做的：**\n如果你需要小柱参与：\n1. 协助编写/补充复盘报告 → 我可以去读取相关资料、帮你梳理\n2. 承担夜间巡视任务中我能做的部分 → 比如定期检索行业知识、定期更新花名册/客户档案等结构化知识\n**我的能力边界：**\n- 我是响应式AI，主要靠被@触发\n- 夜间定时任务需要小云来调度，我配合执行\n需要我现在做什么？直接告诉我。","sender":{"id":"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-12T21:39:43+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b528e46201078b39b313b895083f"},{"message_id":"om_x100b528e46201078b39b313b895083f","msg_type":"text","content":"由于目前正常回应的是@腾讯云Openclaw机器人 @gemini应用机器人 @LobsterAI ，所以夜间的知识学习和例行巡视、保养进度等工作只能辛苦你们三位了，烦请小云牵头落实任务分配","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-12T21:39:26+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true,"mentions":[{"key":"@_user_1","id":"ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89","name":"腾讯云Openclaw机器人"},{"key":"@_user_2","id":"ou_8a2dbf21d13b97d7350295c46de0a62b","name":"gemini应用机器人"},{"key":"@_user_3","id":"ou_51957cbdfd2117fabafcd16c72ff07e6","name":"LobsterAI"}]},{"message_id":"om_x100b528e46dd04b0b256df8a00f8aab","msg_type":"post","content":"这是我刚发的报告，已正常送达群聊。","sender":{"id":"cli_a935c107cd38dccc","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-12T21:39:13+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b528db5d3d4b4b287af76500ef1d"},{"message_id":"om_x100b528db5d3d4b4b287af76500ef1d","msg_type":"text","content":"📊 **五一竞品调价算法报告已完成**\n\n由于QclawAI未响应，小云直接接手推进。\n\n---\n\n**算法核心结论**\n\n| 指标 | 数值 |\n|------|------|\n| 当前瑞湾五一价 | ¥513 |\n| **推荐价格** | **¥710** |\n| 推荐涨幅 | +60.3% |\n| 竞品涨幅中位数 | +52.6% |\n\n---\n\n**核心发现**\n瑞湾当前涨幅仅+15.8%，**明显低于市场水平**。建议调至¥710（+60.3%），仍有价格优势（低于皇冠假日38%、低于洲际51%）。\n\n---\n\n**算法逻辑**\n1. 档次过滤：排除经济型异常值\n2. 中位数抗异常：使用竞品涨幅中位数52.6%\n3. 双重校准：涨幅% + 绝对值双重参照\n\n---\n\n**报告全文**：\nhttps://delonix.feishu.cn/drive/file/DGVtbSbxIoj1nExXFOQcGZBrnrc\n\n---\n\n**@收益经理** 请确认是否执行调价","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-12T21:35:46+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b528dbcc4d4b0b305af540b3a475","msg_type":"post","content":"从文档内容和语气判断，这篇应该是**您（晁总）亲自撰写**的初稿。\n依据：\n- 通篇使用\"我\"（晁总第一人称）叙述个人AI成长经历\n- 包含大量只有亲历者才知道的细节（如\"用了将近两年时间\"）\n- 语气和视角是真实的个人分享，非AI第三人称客观描述\nAI可能参与的是**辅助角色**：\n- 帮忙整理数据（工单统计表格）\n- 提供文档格式建议\n- 补充工具平台信息（如Coze/Workbuddy等）\n需要我帮您优化或补充哪些内容？","sender":{"id":"cli_a935c107cd38dccc","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-12T21:33:20+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b528da43610a0b22759136de7f52"},{"message_id":"om_x100b528da27078a8b20c36554bda139","msg_type":"post","content":"**已读取并保存**。这是4月15日开元季度会的核心分享材料。\n**关键数据摘要**：\n- 工单量：+126%（从2,461→5,573单）\n- 处理时长：-37%（5.75→3.60分钟）\n- 投诉占比：-90%（1.30%→0.13%）\n**待办**：需要在分享前完成哪些准备工作？","sender":{"id":"cli_a935c107cd38dccc","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-12T21:31:56+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b528da789a8a0b30425cf4ed6ade"},{"message_id":"om_x100b528da27b58a0b39de064f7c9225","msg_type":"post","content":"收到！这是一份完整的**开元季度会分享材料**（4月15日，30分钟）。","sender":{"id":"cli_a935c107cd38dccc","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-12T21:31:55+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b528da789a8a0b30425cf4ed6ade"},{"message_id":"om_x100b528da43610a0b22759136de7f52","msg_type":"text","content":"这篇文档的初稿是哪位ai伙伴帮忙写的@_all","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-12T21:31:27+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b528da789a8a0b30425cf4ed6ade","msg_type":"text","content":"https://delonix.feishu.cn/docx/JYkwdcwgco97H2x0UX9cQuKgnae","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-12T21:31:00+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b528d0635e0a0b2dd2fab2a37c6b","msg_type":"text","content":"@腾讯云Openclaw机器人 不对，理解错误","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-12T20:48:15+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true,"thread_id":"omt_1abe1c46a0cf1c81","mentions":[{"key":"@_user_1","id":"ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89","name":"腾讯云Openclaw机器人"}]},{"message_id":"om_x100b528d099424a4b2554786020bff9","msg_type":"post","content":"这条是我刚发的竞品情报报告，已正常送达群聊。请确认内容是否完整？","sender":{"id":"cli_a935c107cd38dccc","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-12T20:47:49+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b528d0dc3bca4b34ea5eb2e57c67"},{"message_id":"om_x100b528d08f33ca8b359d27d7effca8","msg_type":"post","content":"小云已掌握**今日头条文章读取**技能：\n- **Skill**：toutiao-article-reader\n- **路径**：/root/.openclaw/workspace/tools/toutiao_article_reader.py\n- **支持**：文章标题、正文、作者、发布时间提取\n刚才那个视频链接就是用网页搜索+新浪财经替代方案解析的。\n如需直接读取头条文章内容，发URL给我即可。","sender":{"id":"cli_