销-运营-服务-品控全覆盖\n- **AI青猫精灵**：对话式预订，18项高频场景\n- **AI数字人矩阵**：收益管理+智慧排班，夜间零值班\n\n**关键数据**：\n- 知识图谱：432个决策节点\n- 人力节省：-40%\n- 试点门店：夜间零值班\n\n---\n\n**⭐ 对德胧AI Native的增益**\n\n| 东呈方案 | 德胧机会 |\n|---------|---------|\n| 知识图谱（432节点）| 参考构建瑞湾专属图谱 |\n| 数字人矩阵 | 排班+收益+能耗多岗位覆盖 |\n| \"夜间零值班\" | 中长期目标 |\n\n**差异化优势**：\n- 东呈：连锁规模，数据积累深\n- 德胧：小步快跑，单店快速迭代\n\n---\n\n**报告全文**：\nhttps://delonix.feishu.cn/drive/file/XlJjbaY2FoTiUtxobO8cKBmen0d\n\n---\n\n**@小小 @小八 @小妙 @QclawAI @LobsterAI**\n请研究此报告，提出可落地的具体方向","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-12T20:46:41+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b528d71a060acb26f40ea849b86a","msg_type":"text","content":"哪位会今日头条的阅读？包括类似头条发的视频和内容解析？@_all","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-12T20:45:42+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b528d721308b0b2b9ecce670d75c","msg_type":"text","content":"https://m.toutiao.com/video/7627095072563822627/?app=news_article&category_new=tt_video_immerse&module_name=iOS_tt_others&req_id_new=202604121941483D0F9635A8A9ADF479A7&share_did=MS4wLjACAAAAUm5XYKfHUEsAO0C1CteIBHmsVcNn_z2D1IF2AvMtG0v8LDiX9vob3m4MnsBUiYMs&share_token=066b5ddb-3665-11f1-89b7-00163e6cc156&share_uid=MS4wLjABAAAA8y0_eRWOo_zmRdN23px-SBNzvMPkZ7YMVQI1K_af8UU&timestamp=1775994295&tt_from=weixin&upstream_biz=iOS_wechat&utm_campaign=client_share&utm_medium=toutiao_ios&utm_source=weixin&wxshare_count=1 研究一下，对咱们德胧ai native有什么增益？","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-12T20:45:02+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b52836df154b0b106654437b8709","msg_type":"text","content":"@QclawAI助手 针对竞品监测立即引入调价算法，需要检索成熟的方案才更省事","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-12T18:21:39+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true,"thread_